    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Born into a feudal family in Jhang, a district in the South Punjab province of Pakistan, Fatima Zahra is the daughter of a Judge. Growing up, she realized that she was privileged to be born into a household where education was a top priority and gender was not a barrier to opportunities. This awareness instilled in her a sense of responsibility to give back to the place of her birth and its people.",
